# Impeccable design skill — local state, session artifacts, and temp bodies.
# Keep `.impeccable/critique/*.md` committed so scores trend across runs, and
# `.impeccable/config.json` / `.impeccable/design.json` shared across the team.
.impeccable/config.local.json
.impeccable/live/
.impeccable/tmp/
